WEBVTT

00:05:28.163 --> 00:05:31.830
This better-than-nothing behavior
is not your ultimate goal.

00:05:32.263 --> 00:05:36.497
But for now, what could you do
that is ridiculous easy

00:05:36.530 --> 00:05:40.063
that you can do even when
nothing is going as planned?

00:05:40.763 --> 00:05:44.930
Even though you ultimately
might want to do more and be more,

00:05:44.963 --> 00:05:47.897
remember that we humans
are often too tired

00:05:47.930 --> 00:05:49.097
and too stressed

00:05:49.097 --> 00:05:50.730
and too distracted

00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:53.697
to do the things
that we really do intend to do

00:05:53.730 --> 00:05:57.530
and to be the people
that we most intend to be.

00:05:58.530 --> 00:05:59.963
On those days,

00:05:59.963 --> 00:06:03.897
our wildly ambitious behaviors
really are better than nothing.